! MINNESOTA TRAFFIC SCRIPT
! Developer TB
! Version 1.0 - 01/24/2008
! Version 1.1 - 1/16/2009 RR Added PRI and Analog Transfers and Routing. Modified for CCS5
! Version 2.0 - 7/15/2009 TB
! Version 2.1 - 12/3/2009 RR Added remote guardian response capabilities
! Version 2.1a. test only...rr acd testing
! Version 2.2 ACD Release Candidate1 Added Database block for cross department variables
! Version 2.2a Added production patch for Payment Plan payments due today not processing properly.
! Version 2.3  3/11/2010 RR Fixed monitoring path both at sonant in the monitor, and changed this script to look for #8008
! Version 2.4 4/21/2010 RR added resetting of usedobmatch to false and TR_DateOfBirth to null when call returned by agent.
! Version 2.5 5/3/2010 RR added line reset loop. Commented out on 7/12/10
! Version 2.6 6/2/2010 TB Per Shay: send caller who doesn't know court node to ACD
! Version 2.6a 6/22/2010 TB Corrected three courts that didn't have CTI names set 
! Version 2.7 9/27/2010 TB Addition of Plan referred to collection logic
! Version 4   10/19/2010 TB corrected plan with referral from OverallSummaryMenu
! Version 5	10/29/2010 RR Added paymentplans route.
! Version 6    2/22/2012 JP added survey
! Version 6.1  3/8/2012  JP added missing StatE's
! Version 6.2  4/18/2012 Fixed route returns broken by survey logic
! Version 6.3  8/27/2012 added acd_agentcall=1 to acdcall block RR
! Version 6.4  10/4/2012 TB added eCourt logic
! Version 6.4a 10/8/2012 TB small modifications to eCourt messaging
! Version 6.4b 10/27/2012 RR added CPC route after ecourt test.
! Version 6.5  10/31/2012 RR added ecourt on hold messages functionality.
! Version 6.6  10/31/2012 RR Production Changes removing Spanish options
! Version 6.7  11/27/2012 TB added EC and TR specific StatEs
! Version 6.8  01/29/2013 TB Corrected eCourt path so doesn't close at MNCIS time
! Version 6.9  03/25/2013 TB added Fairness Survey
! Version 7.0  04/09/2013 RR Added TestMode Hidden Menu
! Version 7.1  04/10/2013 TB Added branch to send eCourt callers around survey
! Version 7.2  04/15/2013 TB Added DoSurvey branch for callers returned to IVR by agent
! Version 7.2a 04/16/2013 TB Set so callers returned to IVR by agent go to that option not survey
! Version 7.3  04/23/2013 TB Fix to prevent hung line for survey caller who hangs up after ACD agent
! Version 7.4  04/26/2013 TB Added logic for EPS status monitoring
! Version 7.4a 05/09/2013 RR Added ACD_OriginationAddress to send @DestinationAddress for outbound calls
! Version 8.0  05/02/2013 TB Multi-Case changes
! Version 8.1  05/07/2013 TB Added changes to Bail Citation Summary
! Version 8.2  04/24/2014 TB Ramsey & Hennepin addition
! Version 8.2  05/01/2014 TB Removed "Court" msg from PlayBailCaseSummary per Carolyn H.
! Version 8.2a 05/14/2014 TB Modified EPS remote monitor to send alert if EPS_Result not equal to zero
! Version 8.4  12/26/2014 RR Added Appellate court to ecourts.
! Version 8.5  04/28/2015 TB Production script merged with Ramsey & Hennepin addition script
! Version 8.5a 06/25/2015 TB Added some new EPS vars used by dll but not by script
! Version 8.5b 06-29-2015 TB Corrected payment amount play following multi-payment transaction
! Version 8.6  09-23-2015 RR Added ecourt optional greeting functions
! Version 8.7  02-25-2016 RR Fixed looping timeouts in greeting and No Operator 
! Version 8.8 3/2/2016 RR Line Reset
! Version 8.8a 4/12/16 RR db v40 with testmode renamed to ivrtestmode due to jvscript
! Version 8.9 1/25/17 RR Fixed HolidayToday to force AA to false
! Version 8.9a 2/21/17 TB Add HolidayToday check to AcdAvailable to prevent after hours calls to agents
! Version 9.0 6/23/17 RR add appellate court acd group and routing
! Version 9.1 (48) 12/5/17 RR added state 2=noanswer on timeout.
! Version 9.2 2.23.2018  Added Spanish Optional Greeting record and playback.
! Version 9.2a 11/14/2018 TB corrected compare type in custom payment; modified PlanCurrentDue menu to not offer custom payment when on final installment
! Version 10   11/19/2018 TB SHS upgrade
! Version 10.8 2020-04-23	RR Merge of Production v7 and stage v4. Also added optional greeting record and play from a shared drive. Installed in stage as V5 and production as V8
! Version 10.8.1 2020-04-24	RR Ripped out old ecourt remnants in record functions
! Version 10.8.2 2020-04-25	RR Added same share drive optional greeting functions as 10.8 to Spanish
! Version 10.8.3 2020-05-12 TB fixed replay of transacted amount
! Version 10.8.4 2020-05-26 RR Fixed BTTransfer to be a bridge ztelco does not support redirect/transfers, Made route to payment from ACD check that case is entered. If not prompts.
! Version 10.8.5 2020-06-08 RR Fixed RouteCallerAfterAwol to do a stop play first. Changed to accept # or timeout on DOB entry.
! Version 10.8.6 2020-08-06 TB Fixes to callback call completion due to code change. Fix to incorrect dob format handling, clear cart after non A result from HPS.
! Version 10.8.7 2020-08-21 TB MainMenu changes; addition of RemoteHearing menu and route
! Version 10.8.8 2020-09-15 TB Kill block added to deal with queue position= -1 issue
! Version 10.8.9 2020-09-22 RR Removed Callback VAD detection and going straight to answered with detection being if callback menu times out.
! Version 10.8.10 2021-02-09 RR removed calling party from call blocks. Added stats for remote hearing. Added callback completed stat
! Version 10.8.11 2021-02-22 RR Change to only play estimated hold time once at the beggining of the queue
! Version 10.9   2021-02-26 TB Amendment 8 changes to location/hours messaging	
! Version 10.9.1 2021-04-13 RR ReleaseCall Ends call!
! Version 10.9.2 2021-05-02 RR Fixes to HPS First call failures
! Version 10.10  2021-05-25 TB Amendment 9 changes
! Version 10.11  2022-02-08 TB Amendment 11 changes: Removes Remote Hearing menu and MainMenu prompt
! Version 10.12  2022-03-14 TB Modified MakeCallbackCall to end call with OnError
! Version 10.13	 2022-03-21 RR Modified play of estimated time in queue to 1 minute if less than 1 minute. Added stat for agent transfer xfertoSup
! Version 10.14  2023-01-04 RR Added HPS On Hold retry and added partyname back in to call control blocks
! Version 10.15  2023-02-28 TB Added Scheduled Callback-only logic
! Version 10.15a 2023-07-31 TB Changed handling of LogScheduledCallbackRequestOnError
! Version 10.16  2023-08-07 TB Added Survey changes
! Version 10.17	20250728	RR Fixed supervisor transfer (stirshaken) needed origination number defined.
! Version 10.18 20260120	RR Dont Offer Callbacks to urgent callers. will callback before incoming finished. Urgent calls go to top of queue.
